# Secrets / external config (never commit)
#
# NOTE: the real app/google-services.json is NOT committed (it contains the project's API key
# and identifiers). Copy the sanitised template first:
#   cp app/google-services.example.json app/google-services.json   (then fill in your own values)
# The real config stays local; only the sanitised example is tracked.
app/google-services.json

